OL,3,GNEWSARobber banned from city centre
OL,4,Aafter latest spree
OL,5,
OL,6,FA serial shoplifter who elbowed a store
OL,7,Fworker in the face during his latest
OL,8,Fspree has been jailed and banned from a
OL,9,Fcity centre.
OL,11,FJohn Moffatt, 40, had repeatedly stolen
OL,12,Ffrom the North Face shop in Newcastle
OL,13,Fbefore he struck again in July and
OL,14,FAugust, the city's crown court heard.
OL,16,FThe victim, who was hit in the face as
OL,17,Fshe tried to stop Moffat leaving, said
OL,18,Fshe was now concerned about going to
OL,19,Fwork without a security guard present.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
