OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSARobber banned from city centre
OL,4,Aafter latest spree
OL,5,
OL,6,FMoffat, who had 70 offences including
OL,7,F45 shop thefts on his criminal record,
OL,8,Fwas jailed for two years and three
OL,9,Fmonths after admitting robbery and
OL,10,Ftheft. An order banning him from
OL,11,Fentering Newcastle city centre save for
OL,12,Fpre-arranged appointments will last
OL,13,Ffive years.
